				</m-flex>
				<text class="caption">justify evenly</text>
			</view>

			<text class="section" id="align">交叉轴对齐</text>
			<view class="card">
				<view class="align-box">
					<m-flex align="start" gap="medium">
						<m-flex-item><m-button size="small" type="primary">start</m-button></m-flex-item>
						<m-flex-item><view class="tall-block"></view></m-flex-item>
					</m-flex>
				</view>
				<view class="align-box">
					<m-flex align="center" gap="medium">
						<m-flex-item><m-button size="small" type="primary">center</m-button></m-flex-item>
						<m-flex-item><view class="tall-block"></view></m-flex-item>
					</m-flex>
				</view>
				<view class="align-box">
					<m-flex align="end" gap="medium">
						<m-flex-item><m-button size="small" type="primary">end</m-button></m-flex-item>
						<m-flex-item><view class="tall-block"></view></m-flex-item>
					</m-flex>
				</view>
				<view class="align-box">
					<m-flex align="baseline" gap="medium">
						<m-flex-item><m-button size="small" type="primary">baseline</m-button></m-flex-item>
						<m-flex-item><m-text size="large">基线文本</m-text></m-flex-item>
					</m-flex>
				</view>
				<text class="caption">align start / center / end / baseline；未传时沿用 view 默认 stretch</text>
			</view>

			<text class="section" id="wrap">自动换行</text>
			<view class="card">
				<view class="wrap-box">
					<m-flex wrap gap="medium">
						<m-flex-item v-for="i in 10" :key="i"><m-button type="primary">按钮{{ i < 10 ? '0' + i : i }}</m-button></m-flex-item>
					</m-flex>
				</view>
				<text class="caption">wrap（仅 row / row-reverse 生效）：主轴间距为全部子项 margin-left + 容器等值负 margin 补偿（各行行首顶格），行间距为子项 margin-bottom（末行底部多出一段为已知限制）</text>
			</view>

			<text class="section" id="flex">flex 简写</text>
			<view class="card">
				<view class="flex-row">
					<m-flex flex="1" gap="small">
						<m-flex-item><m-button size="small" type="primary">左</m-button></m-flex-item>
						<m-flex-item><m-button size="small" type="primary">左</m-button></m-flex-item>
